chments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112256522093031424", "3_2112256536190099456", "3_2112256552191369217", "3_2112256574727262208"]}, "author_id": "3790120694", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:56:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112256610886402285"], "id": "2112256610886402285", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83c\udf3a Celebrating Tradition, Embracing Togetherness! \ud83c\udf3a\n\nSribhumi Police celebrated the spirit of Durga Puja with a traditional cultural programme at the Police Reserve, keeping alive the rich heritage and festive spirit of Maa Durga. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n@CMOfficeAssam @assampolice @DGPAssamPolice https://t.co/pDz0DWTEZ2", "url": "https://x.com/sribhumipolice/status/2112256610886402285"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 5146, "like_count": 125, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112247494948376576", "3_2112247598010839040"]}, "author_id": "1098908357132464128", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:20:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112247612514644235"], "id": "2112247612514644235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 21714, "like_count": 91, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Sribhumi 11:30 pm, what's up with this sudden crowd on Ashtami/Nabami??\n\nI thought there is not much crowd for this pandal. https://t.co/y46GBrro7z", "url": "https://x.com/lofITechie/status/2112247612514644235"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112244042524393472", "3_2112244069774786560", "3_2112244091895554048", "3_2112244110358917121"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:06:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112244134006358113"], "id": "2112244134006358113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 809, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\ud83d\udccd Haridevpur 41 Pally.\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 Gouranga Kuila.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f The pandal is made using wasted hardware.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 SO, SO, SO STUNNING! This legendary artist is known for using waste materials for creating pandals. He did both 41 Pally &amp; Tridhara Akalbodhan in 2025 &amp; 2026.\n\n\ud83d\udccc #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/BsZKZLqBFp https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112244134006358113"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112233807814537217", "3_2112233807818719232"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:25:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112233816224088460"], "id": "2112233816224088460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83c\udfc6 Another proud moment for NISHAAN!\n\nManiktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja 2026 wins \u201c\u09b8\u09c7\u09b0\u09be \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u201d at Pratidin Pujo Perfect! \ud83c\udf3a\n\nCongratulations to theme artist Aditi Chakraborty!\n\n84 Years of Heritage. One Unforgettable NISHAAN. \u2764\ufe0f\n\n#NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/VEAIj78djo", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112233816224088460"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112221956900884480", "3_2112221971060752384", "3_2112221986273550336", "3_2112222001687678976"]}, "author_id": "1794095386228899841", "created_at": "2026-10-19T16:39:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112222011825209741"], "id": "2112222011825209741", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tridhara Sammilani (Tridhara Akalbodhon) 2026 \n\nTheme: Surasur (\u09b8\u09c1\u09b0-\u0985\u09b8\u09c1\u09b0) \u2014 The Eternal Conflict, conceptualised by award-winning artist Gauranga Kuila, with a landmark installation by eco-artist Chandra Nath Saha (Tilak). My personal favourite pandal !!\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #Kolkata https://t.co/T3ZfuAi5DO", "url": "https://x.com/Light6082/status/2112222011825209741"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112139339476209665", "3_2112139363752738816", "3_2112139392005570560"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-19T11:10:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112139419637645374"], "id": "2112139419637645374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tridhara Sammilani, on Monoharpukur Road in South Kolkata, was founded in 1947. It began with about 15 to 20 members, and the pujo was a homely affair. The club celebrated its 78th year in 2024. https://t.co/QSL8qQ1R6C", "url": "https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2112139419637645374"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112130626350624768", "3_2112130647108329472", "3_2112130663025709056", "3_2112130677307330560"]}, "author_id": "596545730", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:36:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112130693405048957"], "id": "2112130693405048957", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#DurgaPuja2026 \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f The GREATEST FESTIVAL FOR ALL BENGALIS LIKE ME \ud83d\ude4f some NICE PUJO PANDELS OF SOUTH KOLKATA \"TRIDHARA SAMMILANI\", \"DESHOPRIYO PARK\" \ud83d\ude4f NOT INTENDED TO VIOLATE ANY COPYRIGHT \u00a9\ufe0f, CONSENT OR OTHER ISSUES \ud83d\ude4f https://t.co/hmv9Qut4iI", "url": "https://x.com/satadrumajumder/status/2112130693405048957"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112112439328407552", "3_2112112454914482176", "3_2112112472132046848", "3_2112112485428043776"]}, "author_id": "2609353712", "created_at": "2026-10-19T09:23:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112112499139227709"], "id": "2112112499139227709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 398, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112037658465886490", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\ud83d\udccdBJ Block Durga Pujo, Salt Lake, Kolkata \n\nTheme- Somnath Temple https://t.co/LUo7YX0UZ4 https://t.co/2Ve0ZTjLbg", "url": "https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2112112499139227709"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112099012690251776"]}, "author_id": "22793955", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112099068810006898"], "id": "2112099068810006898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "West Bengal Fire Services has issued show-cause notices to Chetla Agrani, Tridhara Sammilani and Ballygunge Cultural Association over alleged fire safety and crowd management lapses following the Chorbagan Durga Puja stampede that killed 19 people. Officials have also ordered the https://t.co/LJ7GrCGLcq", "url": "https://x.com/indiacom/status/2112099068810006898"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097579299397632", "3_2112097594403078144", "3_2112097610458877953", "13_2112097626833461249"]}, "author_id": "704173234334240768", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:25:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097711600345545"], "id": "2112097711600345545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BJ Block Durga Puja Pandal. Theme: Somnath Temple. \u2728\n\n#Kolkata #kolkatanews #WestBengal #DurgaPuja #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/jgIGxx9Y6Q", "url": "https://x.com/ShaunakCy/status/2112097711600345545"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097407140016128", "3_2112097407140057088", "3_2112097407182000128", "3_2112097407169437696"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097414836531229"], "id": "2112097414836531229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097205490528256", "3_2112097205490495488", "3_2112097205448495104", "3_2112097205448499200"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097213392580776"], "id": "2112097213392580776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition and \u201cNISHAAN \u2014 The Mark\u201d finds a place across the press. \ud83d\ude4f\u2728\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M", "url": "https